    {
      "voiceId": "chris-williamson",
      "voiceName": "Chris Williamson",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The UK housing crisis is not going well.\n\nIn order to alleviate its acute housing affordability crisis, London has been set a target of building 88,000 new homes per year over the next decade.\n\nLast year construction started on just 5,891 \u2013 94% below target, a 75% year-on-year decline, the steepest drop in the country, the lowest tally since records began almost 40 years ago and the lowest figure for any major city in the developed world this century.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ChrisWillx/status/2058255554582073498",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-23T18:35:39+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "chris-williamson",
      "voiceName": "Chris Williamson",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Taken from my 3 Minute Monday Newsletter. Sign up and get my free Reading List of 100 life-changing books here:\n\nchriswillx.com/books/",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ChrisWillx/status/2057893681605087512",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-22T18:37:42+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "chris-williamson",
      "voiceName": "Chris Williamson",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "x.com/i/article/205789253351\u2026",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ChrisWillx/status/2057893542903632133",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-22T18:37:09+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "chris-williamson",
      "voiceName": "Chris Williamson",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Don\u2019t fall in love with potential.\n\n\u201cIf you want to ruin your life, spend it trying to change your spouse\u2019s behaviour.\u201d \u2014 Charlie Munger",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ChrisWillx/status/2057808701222801474",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-22T13:00:01+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "chris-williamson",
      "voiceName": "Chris Williamson",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "C. S. Lewis, the feminist.\n\n\u201cThe homemaker has the ultimate career.\n\nAll other careers exist for one purpose only \u2013 and that is to support the ultimate career.\u201d \u2014 C. S. Lewis",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ChrisWillx/status/2057526031666274386",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-21T18:16:47+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "chris-williamson",
      "voiceName": "Chris Williamson",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Taken from my 3 Minute Monday Newsletter. Sign up and get my free Reading List of 100 life-changing books here:\n\nchriswillx.com/books/",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ChrisWillx/status/2057165264769204541",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-20T18:23:14+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "chris-williamson",
      "voiceName": "Chris Williamson",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "x.com/i/article/205716469860\u2026",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ChrisWillx/status/2057165026301989016",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-20T18:22:17+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "chris-williamson",
      "voiceName": "Chris Williamson",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Your greatest growth comes from your lowest moments.\n\n\u201cIt is an unwritten rule of life that after every prolonged period of hardship and uncertainty, there is going to be a period when you are going to achieve quantum leaps across multiple areas of your life.\n\nThe only requirement is that you do not give up on yourself.\u201d \u2014 BeautyOfSaas",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ChrisWillx/status/2057093037310795902",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-20T13:36:13+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
