      "voiceName": "Chris Williamson",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Why you can\u2019t mass produce elite special operators for the military.\n\n\u201cThe percentage of guys with 130+ IQ who enjoy both books and bar fights is incredibly small.\u201d (h/t Link)",
